Offer generator (RAG + Multi-item Excel-priced BOM fallback)
UPDATES:
- Unit estimate line: "Pricing: $X × Qty N = $Y"
- Dimensions parsed from the user's note are injected per item (and overwrite)
- No "?" in dimensions; omit unknown parts
- Qty already multiplies line totals
- If no exact items, ask for similar; on 'no', print a friendly message and exit
- Pricing math done by LLM using the Excel price book (with safe fallback)
- NEW: Multi-note path now prices **ALL** items from the note (no single-item collapse)
- NEW: Robust dimension parsing for bed/sofa/nightstand W/D/H in mm → cm; guaranteed to print in PDF
- NEW: LLM pricing retries & stricter JSON-only guard
"""

